        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A biotic plant stress (PSO:0000011) which is a disorder caused by exposure to a disease-causing organism.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>plant_stress_ontology</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:id>PSO:0000013</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:comment>Disease-causing organisms include fungi, bacteria, viruses and oomycetes.</rdfs:comment>
