                    </owl:Restriction>
                    <owl:Restriction>
                        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0004025"/>
                        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PO_0000003"/>
                    </owl:Restriction>
                    <owl:Restriction>
                        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0014001"/>
                        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_259995"/>
                    </owl:Restriction>
                </owl:intersectionOf>
            </owl:Class>
        </owl:equivalentClass>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A wheat disease caused by a [Hymenula] cerealis affecting a whole plant.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <dcterms:contributor>0000-0002-9013-5974</dcterms:contributor>
        <dcterms:contributor>PSO:cooperl</dcterms:contributor>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>APSNET:Wheat</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>plant_stress_ontology</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <rdfs:comment>Symptoms and signs: The fungus is soilborne. The disease tends to be more prevalent in low, wet areas of fields and in plants grown in acid soil. Under severe conditions, plant stands may be reduced as a result of of pre- or postemergence infection. Infected seedling leaves sometimes have mosaic-like yellowing in late winter or early spring. During jointing and heading, conspicuous, chlorotic, longitudinal stripes appear on leaves. The stripes may initially be diffuse or mottles but eventually become prominently yellow and necrotic on maturing green leaves, usually only one to three stripes and discolored veins are present per leaf.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>wheat Cephalosporium stripe fungal disease</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PSO_0000717"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A wheat disease caused by a [Hymenula] cerealis affecting a whole plant.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>AUTO:patterns/disease</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    </owl:Axiom>
    


