        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>dwarf smut</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>stinking smut</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>plant_stress_ontology</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <rdfs:comment>Only impacts winter wheat; prolonged period of snow cover required for fungal germination; dark-colored bunt spores replace kernels; bunt spores give fishy odor; tiller number increases; plants become shorter (&quot;dwarfed&quot;).</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>wheat dwarf bunt fungal disease</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
